SUNAGAKURE -- UNIT FILE: THE SAND SIBLINGS
Kazekage Office

The Sand Siblings are the children of the Fourth Kazekage and stand among the
most renowned shinobi of the village. Their unit is a byword for Sand strength.

Members:
- Gaara -- youngest sibling, host of the One-Tail, now the Fifth Kazekage. Master
  of sand manipulation; his gourd carries pre-ground sand infused with his chakra.
  He leads the village above the unit.
- Temari -- eldest, jonin. Wind-nature specialist wielding the great three-moon
  war fan; also the village's foremost hand in the Konoha alliance.
- Kankuro -- middle sibling, jonin and Puppet Brigade master. Wields Crow, Black
  Ant, and Salamander in combination.

Unit history: The siblings served together from their genin years, through the
dark days of the Konoha operation, into the present age of alliance under
Gaara's leadership. Kankuro and Temari now form the core of the Kazekage's own
protection. Filed to the Kazekage Office under unit records.
